You'd add a parameter for xi, remove the parameter beta, and
define a generated quantities block:

generated quantities {
   vector[n_item] beta;

   for (i in 1:n_item)

     beta[i] <- xi[i] / gamma[i];
}

Or you could replace the loop with elementwise operations,

   beta <- xi ./ gamma;

- Bob

