The original model is something that comes from basic science. It's a
functional form that comes from the agronomy literature and has been
used to model rice production throughout Asia. e.g., Bouman, B. A. .,
and T. . Tuong (2001), "Field water management to save water and
increase its productivity in irrigated lowland rice," Agricultural Water
Management, 49(1), 11–30, doi:10.1016/S0378-3774(00)00128-1.

