>>      > where rice[i,j] is the rice harvest for village i in year j
>> (in tons per hectare), water[i,j] is the water (in
>>      > millimeters) applied to the fields during the growing season,
>> and alpha, beta, and gamma are parameters (all greater
>>      > than zero) that characterize, respectively, the maximum yield,
>> the water-use efficiency, and the minimum required
