Subject: Non-linear model: horribly mixing chains since rstan v2.1
Message-ID: <HUshsYBEtwA.v_xTIxGnf90J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/HUshsYBEtwA/m/v_xTIxGnf90J>
