Subject: Re: [stan-users] Non-linear model: horribly mixing chains since rstan v2.1
Message-ID: <HUshsYBEtwA.PRnKBuvw3KQJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <HUshsYBEtwA.v_xTIxGnf90J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
