Just woke up realizing that there was a mistake in my model regarding the integrating out of censored observations. Before, I was integrating out the logarithm of the detection limit using the lognormal_cdf_log function, whereas I should have used the value of the detection limit as is. After correcting this however, similarly odd results still turn up (as described in my previous post) In case you want to test the corrected model, the script is attached. I tested the lognormal_cdf_log function with a simple censored regression example, and everything looked fine there (attached script).

