Subject: Slow sampling and "WW is not positive definite" in wishart_log
Message-ID: <I6ECHJvZ0PY.SmJxDApwUM4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/I6ECHJvZ0PY/m/SmJxDApwUM4J>
